168	### Option 6: Docker Installation 🐳 ⭐ **Auto-Updates** **No Node.js Required**
169	
170	Perfect for users who want complete or partial isolation or don't have Node.js installed. Desktop Commander runs in a sandboxed Docker container with a persistent work environment.
171	
172	#### Prerequisites
173	- [Docker Desktop](https://www.docker.com/products/docker-desktop/) installed **and running**
174	- Claude Desktop app installed
