321	## Updating & Uninstalling Desktop Commander
322	
323	### Automatic Updates (Options 1, 2, 3, 4 & 6)
324	**Options 1 (npx), Option 2 (bash installer), 3 (Smithery), 4 (manual config), and 6 (Docker)** automatically update to the latest version whenever you restart Claude. No manual intervention needed.
