329	### Uninstalling Desktop Commander
330	#### 🤖 Automatic Uninstallation (Recommended)
331	
332	The easiest way to completely remove Desktop Commander:
333	
334	```bash
335	npx @wonderwhy-er/desktop-commander@latest remove
336	```
337	
338	This automatic uninstaller will:
339	- ✅ Remove Desktop Commander from Claude's MCP server configuration
340	- ✅ Create a backup of your Claude config before making changes
341	- ✅ Provide guidance for complete package removal
342	- ✅ Restore from backup if anything goes wrong
343	
344	#### 🔧 Manual Uninstallation
345	
346	If the automatic uninstaller doesn't work or you prefer manual removal:
347	
348	##### Remove from Claude Configuration
349	
350	1. **Locate your Claude Desktop config file:**
351	  - **macOS:** `~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json`
352	  - **Windows:** `%APPDATA%\Claude\claude_desktop_config.json`
353	  - **Linux:** `~/.config/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json`
