501	2. **Get Desktop Commander Docker Configuration**
502	   - Visit: https://hub.docker.com/mcp/server/desktop-commander/manual
503	   - **Option A:** Use the provided terminal command for automated setup
504	   - **Option B:** Click "Standalone" to get the config JSON and add it manually to your Claude Desktop config
505	 ![docker-config.png](screenshots/docker-config.png)
506	
507	3. **Mount Your Machine Folders (Coming Soon)**
508	   - Instructions on how to mount your local directories into the Docker container will be provided soon
509	   - This will allow you to work with your files while maintaining complete isolation
510	
511	### Benefits of Docker Usage
512	- **Complete isolation** from your host system
513	- **Consistent environment** across different machines
514	- **Easy cleanup** - just remove the container when done
515	- **Perfect for testing** new features or configurations
